<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 9 June <span class="n">9</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/columba"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/columba.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Columba</span><span class="tp">521–597</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/otto-the-child"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/otto-the-child.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Otto the Child</span><span class="tp">1204–1252</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ambrogio-lorenzetti"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ambrogio-lorenzetti.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Ambrogio Lorenzetti</span><span class="tp">c. 1290–1348</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/jeanne-dalbret"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/jeanne-dalbret.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Jeanne d'Albret</span><span class="tp">1528–1572</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/jose-de-anchieta"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/jose-de-anchieta.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">José de Anchieta</span><span class="tp">1534–1597</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/leonard-calvert"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/leonard-calvert.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Leonard Calvert</span><span class="tp">1606–1647</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/banda-singh-bahadur"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/banda-singh-bahadur.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Banda Singh Bahadur</span><span class="tp">1670–1716</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/charles-dickens"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/charles-dickens.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Charles Dickens</span><span class="tp">1812–1870</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/miguel-angel-asturias"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/miguel-angel-asturias.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Miguel Ángel Asturias</span><span class="tp">1899–1974</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
